WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.520
This page groups the July fifteenth, 2026 roadmap into software compatibility,

2
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:13.690
cache and compute subsystems, and reliability with verification.

3
00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:21.595
Expanded bullets are teaching summaries, not individual official commitments or an

4
00:00:21.595 --> 00:00:24.198
October delivery checklist.

5
00:00:24.198 --> 00:00:29.693
Software profiles mean RISC-V ISA compatibility profiles.

6
00:00:29.693 --> 00:00:34.706
Concrete entries include RVB23 and RVA23 objectives,

7
00:00:34.706 --> 00:00:39.623
Zephyr repository integration and a bare-metal SDK.

8
00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:46.468
They do not establish support for every operating system and toolchain.

9
00:00:46.468 --> 00:00:54.566
Cache work concerns HPDCache, HPICache, platform integration and optional hardening,

10
00:00:54.566 --> 00:00:59.869
not arbitrary cache hierarchies or universal coherence.

11
00:00:59.869 --> 00:01:06.328
Read the vector headings as vector-support and ARA-connection work:

12
00:01:06.328 --> 00:01:12.594
the roadmap discusses reconnecting ARA, possibly through CV-X-IF.

13
00:01:12.594 --> 00:01:19.439
That does not establish vector-extension support in every CVA6 variant.

14
00:01:19.439 --> 00:01:24.163
Multicore directions include CV-TCCC and Culsans;

15
00:01:24.163 --> 00:01:28.791
coordination and scheduling are learning topics,

16
00:01:28.791 --> 00:01:34.190
not fixed core counts or hardware scheduling guarantees.

17
00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:38.528
DCLS, cache hardening, selected verification,

18
00:01:38.528 --> 00:01:44.023
new CI and SSoT tool alignment also have distinct status.

19
00:01:44.023 --> 00:01:50.868
No family-wide safety certification or verification completion follows.

20
00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:57.713
For an entry, find its implementation, tests, release or system record.

21
00:01:57.713 --> 00:02:06.100
The four evidence categories are my teaching framework, not an official quality ladder.

22
00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.667
Completed work and plans can coexist.

23
00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:13.620
Four questions now check these judgments.

